{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟近日確認，已通過2026年10月累計更新修復一項影響Windows 11的音頻相關缺陷。該問題此前導致部分遊戲和應用程式在運行過程中意外崩潰，嚴重時甚至無法正常啓動，引發部分用户投訴。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583454.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:59.836103+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:26:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_hash":"91e411f9986265887e56bc8b99477d38115ccd8450c50d3c3b69848551701c34","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}